---
/* 關於 · About — 草稿沒細畫,做單欄敘事(暗調),內容 placeholder 等 Ivy brand brief */
import PreviewLayout from '~/layouts/PreviewLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '~/assets/featured/01.jpg'; // 暫用代表照,Ivy 之後換肖像 / 工作照
---
<PreviewLayout title="關於 · 景觀丸藝" active="about">
  <section class="about">
    <div class="pv-wrap about-grid">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p class="pv-kicker">About</p>
        <h1 class="pv-display title">關於我</h1>
        <hr class="pv-rule" />
        <p class="lede pv-serif">景觀丸藝是一間以植物、生態與空間為核心的設計工作室，透過微景觀創作與自然棲地設計，探索人與自然之間更深層的連結。</p>
        <p class="body">每件作品從觀察開始，觀察植物的狀態、光與空間的關係、生態系統與地景結構等，將自然環境濃縮於不同尺度的空間之中，打造兼具生命感、美感與環境脈絡的作品。</p>
        <p class="body">設計不受單一風格框架，而是在植物、材料與環境條件之間持續探索各種可能性，透過不同尺度與形式的創作，呈現自然多元而豐富的樣貌。</p>
        <p class="body">我相信景觀作品不只是短暫的藝術裝飾，其創作價值更存在於往後與人共同生活的時間之中。因此在作品交付後，我也持續提供養護與照顧建議，希望降低植物養護的門檻，陪伴顧客與作品一起成長。期待每一座微景觀都能在歲月流轉之中，持續展現自然的變化與魅力。</p>
        <p class="body">Verdant Wanderlust is a studio built around plants, ecology, and space. Through terrarium creation and nature-inspired habitat design, we explore what it means to live in closer connection with the natural world.</p>
        <p class="body">Each piece starts with looking — at how a plant holds itself, how light falls, how ecosystems organize. We take these observations and compress them into works at different scales: spaces that feel alive, grounded in both beauty and ecological context.</p>
        <p class="body">We don't work from a fixed style. We work from conditions — what the plant needs, what the material allows, what the space asks for. The result is always different, because nature itself never repeats.</p>
        <p class="body">A piece doesn't end at delivery. We stay in touch, offering care advice and guidance, because we believe the real life of a terrarium begins after it finds its home. Every piece we make is meant to keep changing — quietly, steadily — the way nature always does.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-fig">
        <Image src={portrait} alt="景觀丸藝" widths={[500, 900]} sizes="(max-width: 880px) 100vw, 460px" loading="eager" class="fig-img" />
        <p class="fig-cap pv-serif">_工作室 / 肖像照待 Ivy 提供_</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PreviewLayout>

<style>
  .about { padding: var(--s-24) 0; }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: var(--s-16); align-items: start; }
  .title { font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5rem); }
  .lede { font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.7rem); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 var(--s-8); }
  .body { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 1.02rem; max-width: 540px; margin: 0 0 var(--s-5); line-height: 1.85; }
  .about-fig { position: sticky; top: 120px; }
  .fig-img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/5; object-fit: cover; display: block; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--r-md); }
  .fig-cap { margin: var(--s-3) 0 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink-faint); text-align: center; }
  @media (max-width: 880px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-10); } .about-fig { position: static; } }
</style>
